        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC70, Universal Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor doors weighing 80 to 140 pounds, Deltana's Universal Door Closer can be standard mounted as well as parallel arm or top jamb mounted. The DC70 is non-handed and has and adjustable backcheck making it easy to install. A dual valve allows for adjustable closing and latching speeds. Includes decorative cover and sex bolts for through bolt mounting. Available in 4 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana DC70 Universal Door Closer Tri-Pack:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check.</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated. R27405 UL Listed 47V5</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a standard plastic full cover.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Universal Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Door Weight: 80 - 140 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection from door with cover: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes center to center: 8-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes center to center: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 3</li>\r\n<li>5 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC703BC.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC7-install.pdf?v=1691095327\" target=\"new\">Deltana DC70 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
